Mirror was added in '''Beta 30.0''' as a 1/5 for 5G Disarmed Taunt that, when taken DMG from any source, would deal as much DMG to a random enemy monster. This makes it somewhat act as an inverse [[MTT Fountain]]. '''Beta 56.0''' reworked it entirely. It gained +2/-2, bringing it to 3/3, changed its Disarmed and Taunt for Transparency and replaced its passive with a Dust of summoning a 3/3 copy of its killer.

=== Stats ===
ATK:

* 1 (Post Beta 30.0)
* 3 (Post Beta 56.0, Current)

HP:

* 5 (Post Beta 30.0)
* 3 (Post Beta 56.0, Current)

Cost: 5

Abilities:

* Disarmed. Taunt. When this takes DMG, deal as much DMG to a random enemy monster. (Post Beta 30.0)
* Transparency. Dust: Summon a 3/3 copy of its killer. (Post Beta 56.0, Current)

Rarity: White (Common)

=== Trivia ===
* Beta 51.1 updated its image.
